# Signing material - never commit release keystores. The shared debug
# keystore is the one exception: it's checked in on purpose so every
# machine (and CI) signs debug builds with the same certificate, which is
# what keeps Google Sign-In's registered SHA-1 valid for everyone.
*.jks
*.keystore
!keystore/debug.keystore
keystore.properties

#  Firebase 
# google-services.json contains project identifiers. The marker needs the app
# to build, so if the team decides to commit it, delete the line below and note
# the decision in the README.
app/google-services.json

